        <h3 class="subhead2 "><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Area Representatives</span></h3><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">President of the United States: <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/contact" target="_self">Donald Trump</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">United States Senator: <a href="https://www.baldwin.senate.gov/" target="_self">Tammy Baldwin</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">United States Senator: <a href="https://www.ronjohnson.senate.gov/public/index.cfm/email-the-senator" target="_self">Ron Johnson</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">United States Congresswoman: <a href="https://gwenmoore.house.gov/district/interactivemap.htm">Gwen Moore</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">State Senator: <a href="http://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/2015/legislators/Senate" target="_self">Alberta Darling</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">State Assembly Representative: <a href="http://docs.legis.wisconsin.gov/2015/legislators/Assembly" target="_self">Jim Ott</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Milwaukee County Supervisor District 13: <a href="http://county.milwaukee.gov/Johnson" target="_self">Willie Johnson, Jr.</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Milwaukee County Supervisor District 3: <a href="http://county.milwaukee.gov/wasserman" target="_self">Sheldon Wasserman</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a aria-label="Milwaukee County Supervisory District Map (PDF) Opens in new window" href="http://www.wfbvillage.org/DocumentCenter/View/235" target="_blank" class="docaccess-activated" data-docaccess-source-url="https://www.wfbvillage.gov/DocumentCenter/View/235" data-url-hash="e299e95b747d7fe5077b714596c80e2fae3492c2c4ab6fb331093e394cae1dd5" data-url-status="disabled">Milwaukee County Supervisory District Map (PDF)</a></span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">